    "body": "Specifically, I think the things in HTML that should be considered \"blocks\" are:\r\n\r\n* the actual algorithm container, obvs\r\n* `<ol>`\r\n* `<dd>`\r\n* maybe `<ul>`? Or perhaps the `<li>` within it? Or maybe neither should establish variable scopes.\r\n\r\nIs there anything else?",
