    "body": "@tabatkins, to clarify, your suggestion is that we don't need to introduce desugaring at all? If so, what do you think should happen at step 3 and what should the value of |result| be in that case?\r\n\r\n```\r\n1.  Let |condition| be false.\r\n2.  If |condition|, then let |foo| be `\"foo\"`.\r\n3.  Let |result| be |foo|.\r\n```",
